A button that copies text to the clipboard and confirms with a drawn check.
[Appica docs](https://appica.dev/ui/components/react/copy-button)

<%= embed AppicaUI::CopyButtonPreview, :default %>

## Usage

```ruby
CopyButton(value: "npm install @appica/ui-react")
CopyButton(target: "#api-key", label: "Copy key")
CopyButton(value: url, variant: :outline, copied_label: "Copied!") { "Copy link" }
```

Built on [Button](<%= page_path(:button) %>) - a small square ghost button unless you say otherwise. `value:` is the
text; `target:` (a CSS selector) copies an element's value or text instead. It falls back to a hidden textarea +
`execCommand` where the Clipboard API is blocked (iframes, plain http).

