## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `value:` | `String` | - | The text to copy. |
| `target:` | `String` | - | A selector: copy that element's value / text. |
| `label:` / `copied_label:` | `String` | "Copy" / "Copied" | Accessible name (and title) at rest / after copying (translated). |
| `timeout:` | `Integer` | `2000` | Milliseconds the copied state lasts. |
| `icon:` | `Symbol` | copy glyph | The resting icon. |
| `variant:` / `size:` | Button's | `:ghost` / `:sm` | Square without a block; a block adds a text label. |

Events: `appica-ui--copy-button:copy` (`{ value }`) and `appica-ui--copy-button:error`. `data-copied` is set while copied.

## Accessibility

- A real `<button>` named by `label:`; after copying its name and a `role="status"` message change to
  `copied_label:`.
- The icon cross-fade and check honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
